y point. When the night ends, it starts again. Night One is free to play now. Wishlist KYC to hear when Early Access opens on Discord: https://discord.gg/hFjnkXpDAu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:26:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036013","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:09:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4829060-1847286114029689","game_id":"steam-4829060","kind":"announcement","title":"KYC Meta Restocking","summary":"Mehtos 247 needs restocking, and tonight it's done from the inside. One of the developers of KYC: K Stands for Killing is stocking the shelves of the gas station live in Unreal Engine 5. Every so often he steps into the game to walk the aisles he just filled, so you see the store go from editor to night shift. Ask anything in chat: how the store was built, where the brands came from, how a customer gets written. Don't mind the knocking from the storeroom. Nobody else does. Night One is free to p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:06:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029689","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:00:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4829060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4829060":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4829060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z"},"5265010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_